      'Rule example: The highest bidder becomes declarer and plays alone against the other two. The declarer must fulfill the contracted bid (e.g. score more card points than the defenders, win the last trick with the trump 7 in Ulti, take no tricks in Betli, or take all tricks in Durchmars). The defenders aim to prevent the declarer from fulfilling the contract.',
